# Daemons of the software-render bring-up: the smallest set of stock Darwin jobs that
# reaches launchd -> backboardd -> SpringBoard with no GPU. Order is bring-up order and is the
# order they are handed to launchd.
#
# Origin: HakiOS, oosexgang/hackios-xnu-userland, userland/build.sh, DARWIN_JOBS (MIT, see
# NOTICE.md), with the same twenty labels. Nothing about them is GPU specific; what makes this
# the software-render set is that Adreno740/AdrenoMetal are not in board.toml and the window
# server is started with the library named in inject.conf.
#
# One label per line; '#' starts a comment. com.apple.wifid is deliberately absent: the radio is
# not part of the acceptance (spec 6) and wifid only adds failed XPC lookups without a driver.
com.apple.notifyd
com.apple.cfprefsd.xpc.daemon
com.apple.cfprefsd.xpc.daemon.system
com.apple.logd
com.apple.syslogd
com.apple.distnoted.xpc.daemon
com.apple.diagnosticd
com.apple.fseventsd
com.apple.containermanagerd
com.apple.containermanagerd.system
com.apple.runningboardd
com.apple.backboardd
com.apple.mobile.usermanagerd
com.apple.mobilegestalt.xpc
com.apple.lsd
com.apple.powerd
com.apple.analyticsd
com.apple.logd_helper
com.apple.iconservices.iconservicesagent
com.apple.pluginkit.pkd
com.apple.SpringBoard
